---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Registration Confirmed — CELPIP Weekly Webinars"
  description="Your webinar registration is confirmed. Check your email for the Google Meet link."
  type="page"
>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top: var(--s-6);">
    <div style="max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
      <div style="font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: var(--s-3);">✓</div>
      
      <h1 style="color: var(--accent);">You're registered!</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin: var(--s-2) 0;">
        Payment confirmed. Your spot is saved.
      </p>

      <div style="height: var(--s-4);"></div>

      <div class="surface" style="padding: var(--s-5); border-radius: 8px; text-align: left; border: 2px solid var(--accent);">
        <h2 style="margin-top: 0; text-align: center;">What happens next</h2>
        
        <div class="stack" style="gap: var(--s-4); margin-top: var(--s-4);">
          <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--s-3); align-items: start;">
            <div style="font-size: 2rem; min-width: 50px; text-align: center;">📧</div>
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin: 0 0 var(--s-1);">Check your email (next 2 minutes)</h3>
              <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted);">
                You'll receive:
              </p>
              <ul style="margin: var(--s-2) 0 0; color: var(--text-muted); padding-left: var(--s-4);">
                <li><strong>Google Meet link</strong> for this Saturday's session</li>
                <li><strong>Calendar invite</strong> (.ics file) to save the date</li>
                <li><strong>Session details</strong>: time, topic, what to prepare</li>
              </ul>
              <p style="margin: var(--s-2) 0 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
                <em>Check spam folder if you don't see it within 5 minutes.</em>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--s-3); align-items: start;">
            <div style="font-size: 2rem; min-width: 50px; text-align: center;">📅</div>
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin: 0 0 var(--s-1);">Add it to your calendar</h3>
              <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted);">
                Click the calendar invite in your email to add the session to Google Calendar, Apple Calendar, or Outlook.
              </p>
              <div style="margin-top: var(--s-2); padding: var(--s-2); background: var(--accent-light); border-radius: 4px;">
                <strong>Saturday at 6:00 PM PST</strong>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--s-3); align-items: start;">
            <div style="font-size: 2rem; min-width: 50px; text-align: center;">🔔</div>
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin: 0 0 var(--s-1);">Get a reminder</h3>
              <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted);">
                We'll send you a reminder email <strong>24 hours before the session</strong> with the Meet link again (just in case).
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--s-3); align-items: start;">
            <div style="font-size: 2rem; min-width: 50px; text-align: center;">🎓</div>
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin: 0 0 var(--s-1);">Join the session</h3>
              <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted);">
                On Saturday at 6:00 PM PST, click the Google Meet link in your email. 
                No account needed—just click and join. 
                Arrive 2-3 minutes early to test your audio/video.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--s-3); align-items: start;">
            <div style="font-size: 2rem; min-width: 50px; text-align: center;">📝</div>
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin: 0 0 var(--s-1);">Session materials sent after class</h3>
              <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted);">
                After the workshop, you'll get a follow-up email with:
              </p>
              <ul style="margin: var(--s-2) 0 0; color: var(--text-muted); padding-left: var(--s-4);">
                <li>Key takeaways from the session</li>
                <li>Practice tasks (specific to this week's topic)</li>
                <li>Link to next week's registration (if you want to continue)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>

      <!-- WHAT TO EXPECT -->
      <div style="text-align: left;">
        <h2 style="text-align: center;">What to expect in your first session</h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-2" style="gap: var(--s-3); margin-top: var(--s-4);">
          <div class="card">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">📌 Session structure</h3>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: var(--s-3); color: var(--text-muted);">
              <li><strong>5 min:</strong> Welcome & introductions</li>
              <li><strong>40 min:</strong> Focused teaching on this week's topic</li>
              <li><strong>15 min:</strong> Live Q&A (ask anything about writing)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">💬 How to participate</h3>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: var(--s-3); color: var(--text-muted);">
              <li>Camera on or off (your choice)</li>
              <li>Use chat or unmute to ask questions</li>
              <li>Bring your questions—no question is "too basic"</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">� This week's topic</h3>
            <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-muted);"><strong>Check your email for details</strong></p>
            <p style="margin: var(--s-2) 0 0; color: var(--text-muted);">
              Your confirmation email includes the exact topic, timing, and what to prepare for Saturday.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">📚 What to bring</h3>
            <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: var(--s-3); color: var(--text-muted);">
              <li>Notebook or device to take notes</li>
              <li>Your specific writing questions</li>
              <li>Optional: a sample essay you've written (for reference)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>

      <!-- HELP SECTION -->
      <div class="surface" style="padding: var(--s-4); border-radius: 8px; text-align: center; background: var(--accent-light);">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Need help?</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--s-3);">
          Didn't get the email? Having trouble with the link? Contact us:
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--s-3); justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="mailto:kara.abdolmaleki@gmail.com" class="btn" style="text-decoration: none;">
            📧 kara.abdolmaleki@gmail.com
          </a>
          <a href="https://wa.me/16479317537" class="btn" style="text-decoration: none;" target="_blank">
            💬 WhatsApp Support
          </a>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top: var(--s-3); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-muted);">
          We typically respond within 1-2 hours.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="height: var(--s-6);"></div>

      <!-- OTHER RESOURCES -->
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <h3>While you wait for Saturday...</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: var(--s-3);">
          Explore our free resources to start preparing:
        </p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--s-3); justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/lessons/writing" class="btn">📝 502 Writing Lessons</a>
          <a href="/blog" class="btn">📚 Strategy Blog</a>
          <a href="/faq" class="btn">❓ FAQ</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="height: var(--s-4);"></div>

      <!-- BACK TO HOME -->
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="/" style="color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: underline;">← Back to homepage</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
    }
  }
</style>
